Implemented a self-contained Track B generator based on the paper’s NAE logic-engine reduction, using the substantive [arXiv v2](https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.15002v2).

Local results:

- All G1–G9(c) gates pass.
- G4: 0/200,000 guesses; exact density ≈ `1.17e-167`.
- G6: five attacks, all 0/8.
- Reference route: 11,479 operations.
- Compact invariant route: 215 operations.
- Answer bound: 221 characters, 56 tokens, 104 atoms.
- Exhaustively verified the NAE parity gadget’s eight-row truth table.

